<<<
It shows inferentially how powerless is that body to carry out any scheme of its own (D. Normal order—how powerless that body is)./Eaperience has taught in what a restricted region can the State as trader or owner act to the general advantage (D. Normal order—the State can act to the general advantage as trader)./How bold is this attack may be judged from the fact that ...(E. Normal order— How bold this attack is)./Why should we be so penalized must ever remain a mystery (E. Normal order —Why we should).
===
*It shows inferentially how powerless* is that body *to carry out any scheme of its own* (D. Normal order—how powerless that body is)./*Experience has taught in what a restricted region* can the State *as trader or owner act to the general advantage* (D. Normal order—the State can act to the general advantage as trader)./*How* bold is *this attack may be judged from the fact that* . . . (E. Normal order—How bold this attack is)./*Why should we* be *so penalized must ever remain a mystery* (E. Normal order—Why we should).
>>>

